{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-6-2-4:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_6_2_4\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_6_2_4:prep:001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"准备条件：合成药X注射制剂150 mg/1.0 mL或生理盐水安慰剂1.0 mL，按随机分配准备；皮下给药；负荷期第1、8、15、22天每周一次共4次，维持期第36天起每两周一次至第24周末次给药。按注射剂无菌操作要求准备，给药前检查外观和颗粒物；安慰剂与试验药同体积、同途径、同频率给药；准备和给药前核对随机号、药物标识、剂量/体积、给药日期和途径，保持双盲并记录实际给药。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_6_2_4:prep:002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"责任方：由研究者或其授权并经培训的临床试验人员负责准备和给药；药物分配与盲态维持由不参与疗效评价的指定人员执行。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_6_2_4:prep:003\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"记录要求：准备、发放、给药和回收均需记录并接受监查。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"3a563cf9a0a5b66d59b6d40eaf7ca27be317638605e34e0593b72f666c19df85"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:505bdb8ba894fde2499ad41e3b3f73c93cdbec8b002bb37147a87295dbf42d7f:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:505bdb8ba894fde2499ad41e3b3f73c93cdbec8b002bb37147a87295dbf42d7f:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"2ecae2d67dff9119be5857ea9516b034dc3f970184ded657dd2415e96453865b","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"2fe383d4-46ed-4fa3-9b09-20554f3646bb","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}